  "releaseNotes": "v13.3 - ProducesEnveloped<T>() / ProducesEnveloped(): documents the success body ToEnvelopedResult writes (OperationDataResult<T> or OperationResult) for OpenAPI, so API docs and generated clients see the envelope and its data type.\n\nv13.2 - ProducesResultProblems(): one call on a route group documents the Problem Details responses (500, 401/403 for authorized endpoints, 422 for endpoints with a body) for OpenAPI, with no extra package dependency. See CHANGELOG.md for full details.",
